{"user_id": "user_09", "query": "Find cheapest hairbrush on Amazon", "outcome": "failed", "items": [{"title": "Avoid looping when searching for specific terms via input fields", "description": "Recognize that repeatedly attempting the same action after a parse failure indicates a potential mismatch between the intended search term and the expected input field context.", "content": "When an agent attempts to type a phrase into an input field but receives a parse error, it should immediately verify whether the current focus is indeed an input field rather than looping indefinitely or retrying the same action. A successful strategy involves first checking if the required element (e.g., search bar) exists and is active before proceeding with typing actions."}, {"title": "Ensure input parameters align with the tool's expected syntax", "description": "Prioritize validating the format and argument structure of commands before executing them to avoid runtime failures.", "content": "An agent must ensure that its selected command arguments (such as \"type\") match the specific requirements of the underlying tool or platform being used. If a command is known to fail due to syntax issues, attempting different variations of the same logic without adjusting the command structure will not yield results; instead, the agent should refactor the command to comply with expected parameters before execution."}, {"title": "Implement early termination for repetitive failed actions", "description": "Detect patterns of repeated failure and trigger an abort strategy immediately to prevent resource wastage.", "content": "When a plan fails multiple times consecutively or involves repeating the same action without resolution, the agent should invoke a stopping mechanism rather than continuing to loop through identical steps. This prevents the system from wasting computational resources and allows for immediate re-evaluation of the overall plan instead of blindly persisting on an ineffective approach."}], "embedding": [-0.04236098378896713, -0.037097204476594925, 0.023475389927625656, 0.004261226858943701, 0.022311124950647354, 0.001980224158614874, -0.05476884916424751, 0.04355055093765259, -0.00742311030626297, 0.04332990571856499, 0.024652214720845222, 0.007623526733368635, -0.02564864605665207, 0.022924501448869705, 0.026669902727007866, 0.025140076875686646, -0.005201778840273619, 0.029896559193730354, 0.018587570637464523, -0.01201777532696724, -0.05563453212380409, 0.0202347319573164, 0.024387530982494354, 0.039851114153862, -0.005745670758187771, 0.010754808783531189, -0.019312631338834763, -0.11166588962078094, -0.012370716780424118, -0.03540950268507004, 0.03591695427894592, 0.029018040746450424, 0.00675172870978713, -0.07188747823238373, 0.019398190081119537, -0.06466668099164963, 0.04482090100646019, 0.05926412716507912, -0.004173515364527702, 0.01395469531416893, -0.07264012098312378, -0.0007069908897392452, -0.059190940111875534, 0.007160945795476437, 0.044513486325740814, -0.009753597900271416, 0.0162095557898283, 0.06708423793315887, 0.08786187320947647, 0.04886817932128906, 0.0012130620889365673, -0.11473790556192398, 0.008394317701458931, -0.07267705351114273, -0.028475448489189148, 0.0013585477136075497, 0.015296677127480507, 0.026231054216623306, 0.04101869463920593, 0.030071508139371872, 0.00652733538299799, -0.07466908544301987, -0.06374558806419373, 0.030194416642189026, -0.017675193026661873, 0.02369348146021366, 0.012330877594649792, 0.03896864503622055, -0.012334013357758522, -0.038594819605350494, -0.10083445906639099, -0.026278143748641014, -0.05809764564037323, 0.10314588993787766, 0.05993898957967758, 0.05169381946325302, 0.09400800615549088, -0.05728458613157272, -0.046502117067575455, 0.006029807962477207, -0.07206036150455475, -0.07773568481206894, 0.02557036653161049, 0.06286273151636124, 0.11243756115436554, 0.017977360635995865, 0.05281469225883484, -0.03852315992116928, 0.06814052164554596, -0.041745733469724655, -0.0412